Description:
    Upgrades a deploy_pins table created before DeployPin 1.7: adds the
    progress and completed_at columns for resumable tasks, and marks the
    existing records as completed. On a table that already has those columns
    (created by DeployPin 1.7 or later) the migration changes nothing. It
    cannot be rolled back, so a rollback never removes task state.
    Outside Rails, run `deploy_pin upgrade`.

Example:
    rails generate deploy_pin:upgrade

    This will create:
        db/migrate/upgrade_deploy_pins.rb
